// Glass (ADR-0043) — one of DashDeck's two looks. Cool blue-black surfaces like smoked glass, an ice
// blue accent, rounder corners, and the frosted climate panel and arcs console that go with it. The
// stage is the chrome F-150 cluster.
//
// Every token is explained in docs/writing-a-theme.md. To make your own from this: Settings ▸ Themes
// ▸ SAVE AS, then edit the copy. The four quality colours are not tokens (ADR-0013).
